{"type":"llm_response","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:28:34.503Z","data":{"turn":295,"content":"{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"The page loaded - the dialog was accepted. The page URL confirms we're at the uploaded HTML file. Now let me take a screenshot to confirm.\\n\\nActually, the timeout during `goto` followed by successful `dialog-accept` which shows the page URL is the uploaded HTML file confirms that:\\n1. The HTML file was served from the `/uploads/` directory\\n2. The `<script>` tag in the HTML executed (causing the alert dialog)\\n3. The alert dialog appeared and was dismissed\\n\\nThis confirms the stored XSS via file upload vector! Let me take a screenshot to document it.\",\"signature\":\"\"}","timestamp":"2026-04-08T08:28:34.503Z"}}
